            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ndabaza: Mbega bātsitariye kugwa mahera? Eka na mba! Yamar’ ukugwa kwabo kwāzaniye abanyamahanga agakiza, ngo bitere Abisirayeli ishari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, k’ukugwa kwabo ar’ ubutunzi bg’abari mw isi, n’ukugabanuka kwabo ar’ ubutunzi bg’abanyamahanga, ukugwira kwabo ntikuzorushiriza cane?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
